<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 15.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA - NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JULY 15.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines from Estonia's Kuku radio noon news report on Tuesday.  Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Estonia's police arrested Internet blackmailer Viktor, who had threatened to blow up Latvian stores and hotels, Latvian police said.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 620 9201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
